  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IAC Convention outreach to decision makers in the IAC member countries to.raise awareness and communicate recommendations of actions to mitigate the.threats of East Pacific leatherback turtles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will; 1) convene national technical workshops in East Pacific leatherback range states to review scientific knowledge to determine priority actions to address leatherback fisheries bycatch; and 2) arrange meetings with high level governmental decision makers in these same range state countries to discuss implemtation of priority actions identified by national workshops.</narrative>
  </description>
